# Forgekit

- This is a Next.js 16 app with Cache Components. Check `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using request APIs (`cookies`, `headers`, `params`).
- Auth tables are generated by `@better-auth/cli`. Extend `lib/db/schema.ts` for product tables and pass only `user`, `session`, `account`, and `verification` into the Better Auth adapter.
- Chat uses AI SDK UI messages (`parts`), not a hand-rolled text protocol. Persist the messages returned by `toUIMessageStream` `onEnd`.
- Embeddings are 1536-dimensional. Do not change the vector column without a migration.
- `webFetch` must keep the public-URL checks in `lib/security/url.ts`.
- Show a provider in the picker only when its key, or `OLLAMA_BASE_URL`, is configured.
- Run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm build` after behavioral changes.
